{"4616730": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Supernova Deliveries", "steam_appid": 4616730, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SURVIVE THE TRADE ROUTES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You start with a basic convoy and a single goal: to prosper. Save credits, gather materials, and upgrade your fleet step by step. In deep space, the difference between a successful delivery and disaster depends on your ability to manage what you have.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4616730/extras/8fc05613966f86f5767974ab363ec5ac.poster.avif?t=1776191743\" width=1152 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4616730/extras/8fc05613966f86f5767974ab363ec5ac.webm?t=1776191743\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4616730/extras/8fc05613966f86f5767974ab363ec5ac.mp4?t=1776191743\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MANAGEMENT AND PRIORITIES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dealing with a limited inventory is part of your daily routine. You must prioritize which resources to keep and how to organize your cabin in the most efficient way. Plan your routes wisely: a miscalculation with fuel or a maintenance failure will leave you at the mercy of the void.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4616730/extras/865f58b9d5c969ed3a337389204e37c1.poster.avif?t=1776191743\" width=1152 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4616730/extras/865f58b9d5c969ed3a337389204e37c1.webm?t=1776191743\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4616730/extras/865f58b9d5c969ed3a337389204e37c1.mp4?t=1776191743\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>LOGISTICS AND MARKET</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The cycle is clear: complete deliveries, sell materials, and scavenge for scrap. Every resource counts toward financing your fleet upgrades. Personalize your cargo capacity and core systems to face increasingly long and profitable journeys.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4616730/extras/e226a5e6292a27b52fae79d2e8d563e7.poster.avif?t=1776191743\" width=1152 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4616730/extras/e226a5e6292a27b52fae79d2e8d563e7.webm?t=1776191743\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4616730/extras/e226a5e6292a27b52fae79d2e8d563e7.mp4?t=1776191743\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HAZARDS OF THE ROAD</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are not alone on the trade routes. Space pirates will try to seize your cargo, and asteroid fields will test the integrity of your hull. Keep your ships in top condition, defend your convoy, and ensure the goods reach their destination—no matter the cost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4616730/extras/e5c310b83ae5449774c696b2b3ad3811.poster.avif?t=1776191743\" width=1152 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4616730/extras/e5c310b83ae5449774c696b2b3ad3811.webm?t=1776191743\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4616730/extras/e5c310b83ae5449774c696b2b3ad3811.mp4?t=1776191743\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SURVIVE THE TRADE ROUTES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You start with a basic convoy and a single goal: to prosper. Save credits, gather materials, and upgrade your fleet step by step. In deep space, the difference between a successful delivery and disaster depends on your ability to manage what you have.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4616730/extras/8fc05613966f86f5767974ab363ec5ac.poster.avif?t=1776191743\" width=1152 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4616730/extras/8fc05613966f86f5767974ab363ec5ac.webm?t=1776191743\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4616730/extras/8fc05613966f86f5767974ab363ec5ac.mp4?t=1776191743\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MANAGEMENT AND PRIORITIES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dealing with a limited inventory is part of your daily routine. You must prioritize which resources to keep and how to organize your cabin in the most efficient way. Plan your routes wisely: a miscalculation with fuel or a maintenance failure will leave you at the mercy of the void.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4616730/extras/865f58b9d5c969ed3a337389204e37c1.poster.avif?t=1776191743\" width=1152 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4616730/extras/865f58b9d5c969ed3a337389204e37c1.webm?t=1776191743\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4616730/extras/865f58b9d5c969ed3a337389204e37c1.mp4?t=1776191743\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>LOGISTICS AND MARKET</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The cycle is clear: complete deliveries, sell materials, and scavenge for scrap. Every resource counts toward financing your fleet upgrades. Personalize your cargo capacity and core systems to face increasingly long and profitable journeys.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4616730/extras/e226a5e6292a27b52fae79d2e8d563e7.poster.avif?t=1776191743\" width=1152 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4616730/extras/e226a5e6292a27b52fae79d2e8d563e7.webm?t=1776191743\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4616730/extras/e226a5e6292a27b52fae79d2e8d563e7.mp4?t=1776191743\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HAZARDS OF THE ROAD</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are not alone on the trade routes. Space pirates will try to seize your cargo, and asteroid fields will test the integrity of your hull. Keep your ships in top condition, defend your convoy, and ensure the goods reach their destination—no matter the cost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4616730/extras/e5c310b83ae5449774c696b2b3ad3811.poster.avif?t=1776191743\" width=1152 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4616730/extras/e5c310b83ae5449774c696b2b3ad3811.webm?t=1776191743\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4616730/extras/e5c310b83ae5449774c696b2b3ad3811.mp4?t=1776191743\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "Transport cargo, optimize your inventory, and upgrade your convoy. Command your space-truck through a 2D pixel-art space filled with asteroids and hostile pirates and master the art of deep space logistics.", "supported_languages": "English, Catalan, Spanish - Spain", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4616730/ec5fe295e6f7dff230af915480b6119de989c29b/header.jpg?t=1776191743", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4616730/b1407f3a61a2abdedebd15b023e2be0cf6f5b248/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1776191743", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4616730/b1407f3a61a2abdedebd15b023e2be0cf6f5b248/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1776191743", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3 o equivalente<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD 4000 o superior<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 10<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5 / AMD Ryzen 5 o superior<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1050 / AMD Radeon RX 560 o superior<b